# Read by Firebase at deploy time and set as the function's environment. Not secret — these are
# just the origins allowed to ask for a handoff token.
#
# Production is listed outright rather than left to the wildcard: the live site should not stop
# working because somebody tightened a pattern. The wildcard is only there for Vercel's
# per-push preview URLs, which are a new domain every time.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://agent-fence.vercel.app,http://localhost:5173,https://*.vercel.app,http://localhost:5176
